### Option 1: Instant Browser View (Zero Setup)
Simply double-click or open [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/shrey/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/vidyasetu-adaptive-learning/index.html) in any browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave, Safari). Everything works immediately offline!

