## 📡 REST API Endpoints (Section 6 Data Schema)

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/api/health` | Health & DPDP Act compliance status |
| `GET` | `/api/dag/graph` | Directed Acyclic Knowledge Graph (multi-year prerequisites) |
| `POST` | `/api/dag/reverse-traverse` | Reverse traversal to pinpoint root-cause prerequisite gaps |
| `POST` | `/api/student/exit-ticket-evaluate` | Evaluates Exit Ticket with Confidence Matrix calibration |
| `GET` | `/api/teacher/rule-of-three` | Returns Sprint/Guided/Bridge clusters & 3-min blackboard lesson |
| `POST` | `/api/zerodevice/scan-batch` | Simulates optical paper scan of 50 exit slips in <60 seconds |

